{# @var recipient \App\Entity\User #}
{# @var space \App\Entity\Space #}
<p>Hi {{ recipient.givenName ?: recipient.email }},</p>

<p>Your export of the space <strong>{{ space.name }}</strong> is ready. It
contains the space's projects, tasks, pages, discussions, comments, and
attachments as a zip archive.</p>

<p>
    <a href="{{ downloadUrl }}">Download your export</a>
</p>

<p>
    This link expires on {{ expiresAt|date('F j, Y') }} — after that the
    archive is deleted and you'll need to request a new export.
</p>

<p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px;">
    You'll need to be signed in to Madori as an admin of this space to download
    the file — the link only works for space admins, not for anyone who
    happens to receive it.
</p>

<p>&mdash; Madori</p>
